        "en": "Usage billing",
        "zh": "用量计费"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Aggregates real token usage from local session logs, locks each cost at the price in effect when the event happened, and shows monthly budget progress in the sidebar, under the composer and in Settings. Reads local session logs only; optionally fetches public price and FX data.",
        "zh": "从本机会话日志聚合真实 token 用量，按事件发生时刻的价格写时锁定，并在侧栏入口、输入框下方胶囊与「设置 → 计费」中显示月度预算进度。仅读取本机会话日志；可选联网获取公开价目与汇率。"
      },
